","source_cn":"看着报纸上被特意标出的<style=highlight...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:24:1721205021":{"key":"choice_prompt:24:1721205021","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"24","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1721205021","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"看着报纸上被特意标出的<style=highlight>百病全消，长生不老</style>，你忍不住叹了口气……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:25:1721205022:1":{"key":"say:25:1721205022:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"25","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1721205022","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"谢谢你，梅林。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:26:1721205023:1":{"key":"say:26:1721205023:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"26","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1721205023","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"葛朗台男爵将具体的时间、地点都写在了这封献宝函中，另外...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:27:1721205024:1":{"key":"say:27:1721205024:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"27","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1721205024","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"请收下它吧。接下来的调查工作，就拜托你了。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:28:509:0":{"key":"document:28:509:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"28","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"尊敬的王后陛下：\n自从听说国王陛下病重，葛朗台我，一直心急如焚、夜不能寐！\n早上吃着极品的帝王鲑，我却只顾着回忆国王陛下的英明政举；中午午休，我一闭上眼，就想起陛下为赛凡纳的付出；\n就连晚上去欣赏舞者帕夫洛娃的芭蕾舞剧，我还是在想着陛下——\n啊，要是失去了陛下，赛凡纳该成什么样！王后陛下又该如何劳累！一想到这里，我就泪流满面，痛心不已……\n于是，我特意派人四处搜寻能救国王的药。终于，功夫不负有心人，我找到了这条神鱼！\n这种名叫霓光鲤的鱼，只是喝了用它熬煮的鱼汤就能令青春常驻；像是这种罕有的极品还能直接入药，喝了就能百病全消！\n尽管买下它，花了我足足百万金的巨款……但为了国王陛下与王后陛下，这一切—都是值得的！\n只是霓光鲤十分娇贵，我担心自己运输出了问题，就先养在了家附近的河道。\n<style=\"highlight\">明日上午</style>，还请王后陛下派遣守备军前往<style=\"highlight\">上城区拱桥附近的河道</style>，亲自带走神鱼，以保神鱼安全无虞！\n——您最忠诚的葛朗台男爵，敬上","textdes_id":"509","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"献宝函","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4.png","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item4.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"document:29:510:0":{"key":"document:29:510:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"29","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"极品霓光鲤神鱼，洞悉一切病灶，治愈万物痛苦。","textdes_id":"510","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"霓光鲤画像","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_gallery6.png","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item11.prefab","document_pic":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_episode07_bigjinli.png","document_gender":"false"},"choice:24:0:1":{"key":"choice:24:0:1","kind":"choice","source_node_id